# Film 1 of still.fail in use on the iPhone Duo simulator, in English (story scripts/story/iduo-en.json, FILM_LANG=en).
timeout 45000
until Message
# (the film once the app is on the screen as it stays: its first frames, as it starts, are none of the story)
wait 1200
at start
wait 1500
# (the list open over the chat as the outer screen lights: the chat tapped where it shows at the right, the list goes)
at tap=chat
tapxy 430 330
wait 1200
at tap=发消息
tap Message
wait 900
at type=The sign-in
type The sign-in
wait 700
at type= button is hard
type  button is hard
wait 800
at type= to see in dark
type  to see in dark
wait 750
at type= mode, fix it
type  mode, fix it
wait 650
at tap=send
tap icon:arrow-up
wait 500
at kb-down
tapxy 250 140
wait 600
at working
wait 2000
until Sign out
at answer
wait 1500
at unfold
log UNFOLD
wait 4500
at pic
tap img:after
wait 2000
at back
back
wait 900
at scroll
dragon 0 -320 450 Sign out
wait 900
at tap=合并
tap =Merge
until 4f2a9c1
at merged
wait 3200
at end
exit
